# "If a nontoken creature would enter and it wasn't cast, exile it instead." (CR 614.1a.) Containment Priest is cast
# first - a cast creature enters, and it does not replace its own entry anyway - and then Bot1 reanimates Bot2's
# Phyrexian Dragon Engine, discarded to Faithless Looting. The Dragon Engine would enter, was not cast, and is exiled
# instead; Reanimate's life loss still happens, three for its mana value.

[Bot1 Deck]
Reanimate
Swamp
Swamp
Mox Pearl
Containment Priest
Island x2
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Phyrexian Dragon Engine
Faithless Looting
Mountain x5
Mountain x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Containment Priest.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Mox Pearl; Containment Priest
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot2.Choose(Phyrexian Dragon Engine; Mountain)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Reanimate.Cast(Bot2.Graveyard.Phyrexian Dragon Engine)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Life = 17
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Swamp; Mox Pearl; Containment Priest
Exile = Phyrexian Dragon Engine
Bot2.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Mountain
